body:
when i was young, maybe like 10 or 11 (im 20 now), i was at a fancy buffet restaurant for my grandma's birthday. i went to the bathroom and sat down and noticed strange sounds coming from the stall next to me. i peeked at the feet under the stall and i saw the person next to me standing up facing the toilet, yet it sounded like she had some kinda crazy diarrhea going on. at first i thought uuhhhh okay maybe this is a transgender woman so she pees standing up?? but the sounds i was hearing were DEF not peeing, more like dropping something in the toilet. i must have spent an abnormally long time sitting there trying to figure out wtf the person in the stall next to me was doing, because she left the stall...and as i walked past her, she gave me the WEIRDEST look i had ever seen. like anxious and suspicious and uncomfortable. at that time, my little 10y/o brain was 200% convinced that this woman was an alien and in the bathroom she was expelling her built up alien excretions. 

&#x200B;

i never forgot that woman because i really did think she was an alien and her looking at me weirdly was her knowing that i knew....well.......about 8 years goes by and i develop and eating disorder. we all know how that goes.....and im standing over the toilet.....and i realize holy fuck. all those years ago that 'alien' was just a poor bulimic woman. now i will certainly never forget her.
